text": "say that it was fake. It was all lies."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4254.63, "timestamp": "01:10:54", "text": "But no, that wasn't the reality. Ly poo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.39, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "could not believe that his baby fish"}]